    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play as a Gorilla or Samurai and destroy Ronin.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get your sword and fight the Ronin! Annihilate the Vagabonds! Protect the Emperor and still be done in time for work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/extras/0691137284078ae98def074052df9f24.poster.avif?t=1753733221\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/extras/0691137284078ae98def074052df9f24.webm?t=1753733221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/extras/0691137284078ae98def074052df9f24.mp4?t=1753733221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Red River takes weapons, jewellry and modifiers and gives out build-focused gameplay with a good dose of hack&amp;slash. Grab your weapons and defend your clans honor!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/extras/80b799f03063c4e24a475212bbd8e665.poster.avif?t=1753733221\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/extras/80b799f03063c4e24a475212bbd8e665.webm?t=1753733221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/extras/80b799f03063c4e24a475212bbd8e665.mp4?t=1753733221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Will your gear endure all the carnage? Is your legendary Ninjato in top shape? Did you bring enough shurikens with you? The Empire depends on you. Will you see the sun rising, or will the sun see you setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> This game is designed mobile-first, it is available on the Google Play store under the name : Samurai Roguelike Offline RPG . Worry not, the PC version has no ads and IAPs.   <br>Music by Makai Symphony, Icons from </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play as a Gorilla or Samurai and destroy Ronin.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get your sword and fight the Ronin! Annihilate the Vagabonds! Protect the Emperor and still be done in time for work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/extras/0691137284078ae98def074052df9f24.poster.avif?t=1753733221\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/extras/0691137284078ae98def074052df9f24.webm?t=1753733221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/extras/0691137284078ae98def074052df9f24.mp4?t=1753733221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Red River takes weapons, jewellry and modifiers and gives out build-focused gameplay with a good dose of hack&amp;slash. Grab your weapons and defend your clans honor!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/extras/80b799f03063c4e24a475212bbd8e665.poster.avif?t=1753733221\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/extras/80b799f03063c4e24a475212bbd8e665.webm?t=1753733221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378790/extras/80b799f03063c4e24a475212bbd8e665.mp4?t=1753733221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Will your gear endure all the carnage? Is your legendary Ninjato in top shape? Did you bring enough shurikens with you? The Empire depends on you. Will you see the sun rising, or will the sun see you setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> This game is designed mobile-first, it is available on the Google Play store under the name : Samurai Roguelike Offline RPG . Worry not, the PC version has no ads and IAPs.   <br>Music by Makai Symphony, Icons from </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
